{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack mcp"},{"type":"text","value":" has been removed from the CLI."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use direct CLI commands for agent introspection and automation."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"command-mapping","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Command Mapping"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Old MCP Tool"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"New CLI Command"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"listTanStackAddOns"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getAddOnDetails"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack create --addon-details drizzle --framework React --json"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createTanStackApplication"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack create my-app --framework React --add-ons drizzle,clerk"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack_list_libraries"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack libraries --json"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack_doc"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack doc query framework/react/overview --json"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack_search_docs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start --json"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack_ecosystem"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack ecosystem --category database --json"}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"recommended-agent-workflow","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recommended Agent Workflow"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use JSON output for deterministic parsing:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json\ntanstack create --addon-details tanstack-query --framework React --json\ntanstack libraries --json\ntanstack search-docs \"loaders\" --library router --framework react --json\ntanstack ecosystem --category auth --json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"important-notes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Important Notes"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The CLI MCP server is removed and will not be restored."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Existing MCP client configs pointing to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/cli mcp"},{"type":"text","value":" will break and should be removed."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The app-level "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mcp"},{"type":"text","value":" add-on is still available for projects that want to host their own MCP endpoints."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"command-mapping","text":"Command Mapping","level":2},{"id":"recommended-agent-workflow","text":"Recommended Agent Workflow","level":2},{"id":"important-notes","text":"Important Notes","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n`tanstack mcp` has been removed from the CLI.\n\nUse direct CLI commands for agent introspection and automation.\n\n## Command Mapping\n\n| Old MCP Tool | New CLI Command |\n|---|---|\n| `listTanStackAddOns` | `tanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json` |\n| `getAddOnDetails` | `tanstack create --addon-details drizzle --framework React --json` |\n| `createTanStackApplication` | `tanstack create my-app --framework React --add-ons drizzle,clerk` |\n| `tanstack_list_libraries` | `tanstack libraries --json` |\n| `tanstack_doc` | `tanstack doc query framework/react/overview --json` |\n| `tanstack_search_docs` | `tanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start --json` |\n| `tanstack_ecosystem` | `tanstack ecosystem --category database --json` |\n\n## Recommended Agent Workflow\n\nUse JSON output for deterministic parsing:\n\n```bash\ntanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json\ntanstack create --addon-details tanstack-query --framework React --json\ntanstack libraries --json\ntanstack search-docs \"loaders\" --library router --framework react --json\ntanstack ecosystem --category auth --json\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- The CLI MCP server is removed and will not be restored.\n- Existing MCP client configs pointing to `@tanstack/cli mcp` will break and should be removed.\n- The app-level `mcp` add-on is still available for projects that want to host their own MCP endpoints.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: mcp-migration\ntitle: MCP Migration\n---\n\n`tanstack mcp` has been removed from the CLI.\n\nUse direct CLI commands for agent introspection and automation.\n\n## Command Mapping\n\n| Old MCP Tool | New CLI Command |\n|---|---|\n| `listTanStackAddOns` | `tanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json` |\n| `getAddOnDetails` | `tanstack create --addon-details drizzle --framework React --json` |\n| `createTanStackApplication` | `tanstack create my-app --framework React --add-ons drizzle,clerk` |\n| `tanstack_list_libraries` | `tanstack libraries --json` |\n| `tanstack_doc` | `tanstack doc query framework/react/overview --json` |\n| `tanstack_search_docs` | `tanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start --json` |\n| `tanstack_ecosystem` | `tanstack ecosystem --category database --json` |\n\n## Recommended Agent Workflow\n\nUse JSON output for deterministic parsing:\n\n```bash\ntanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json\ntanstack create --addon-details tanstack-query --framework React --json\ntanstack libraries --json\ntanstack search-docs \"loaders\" --library router --framework react --json\ntanstack ecosystem --category auth --json\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- The CLI MCP server is removed and will not be restored.\n- Existing MCP client configs pointing to `@tanstack/cli mcp` will break and should be removed.\n- The app-level `mcp` add-on is still available for projects that want to host their own MCP endpoints.\n"}
